title start
kind: note
tags: business-plan strategy competitor-content-audit
Strategy competitor content audit
title end

paragraph start
The content audit looks at the last thirty posts of a competitor and counts formats, subjects, hooks and posting days. It finds what the audience rewards, not what the competitor believes works.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
1 open the profile and list the last thirty posts
2 note format, subject and opening line of each
3 note views and comments of each
4 mark the five best and the five worst
5 write what the best have in common
code end

